[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――それから半年後のこと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—Six Months Later"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "字幕",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Caption"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ、いる？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina, are you in?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、ヤンネさん！\u3000ちょっと今取り込んでて……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, Janne! I'm kind of in the middle of something..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "急ぎの用事なの。切り上げられない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's urgent. Can you wrap it up?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うーん、用件次第かなあ～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm, depends what it's about."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "星の案内人のあなたにしか頼めない用事よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's something only you can handle as Star Guide."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どういうこと？\u3000今日はお仕事入ってないんだけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What do you mean? I don't have any duties scheduled today..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "急な来客があって、対応しなくちゃならないの。\n神官長直々の要請よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We have unexpected visitors that need attending to. It's a direct request from the High Priest."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、今日って定期船が着く日でもないよ？\n来客っていったいどこから……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But the regular ship isn't due today. Where could visitors be coming from..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――ランターナ大陸よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lantarna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えええええええええっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "WHAAAAAT!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあっ……はあっ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*pant*... *pant*..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大陸から人がやって来るなんて……しかも！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Someone from the mainland coming here... and not just anyone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大陸出身の錬金術士……！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "An alchemist from Lantarna...!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どんな人なんだろう。\nあの頂獣を倒したってホントなのかな！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wonder what they're like. Could it be true that they defeated that Apexi!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "早く会いたい……話したい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can't wait to meet them... to talk to them!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（師匠がこの国を去ってから、また何もない日常に\n\u3000戻りかけていた）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(After Master August left Nova, everything was starting to return to that same old routine.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（でも……今度こそ、何かが変わる気がする！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But... this time, I can feel it—something's about to change!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "待ってろおおお！\u3000大陸の錬金術士！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just you wait! Alchemist of Lantarna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]